# Neither command needs a credential to read Claude Academy or to serve the API.
# The settings below are read from the collector's process environment (for example a
# launchd or systemd job definition). All are optional.
# CLAUDE_ACADEMY_SNAPSHOT_PATH=/srv/claude-academy/snapshot.json
# CLAUDE_ACADEMY_COLLECTOR_STATE=/srv/claude-academy/collector
# Cloudflare purge of one hostname after each publication. Set all three or none:
# CLAUDE_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
# CLAUDE_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_HOSTNAME=api.example.com
# CLAUDE_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_PURGE_TOKEN_FILE=/srv/claude-academy/cache-purge-token
